WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.033
- All right, state
your name and power.

00:00:03.066 --> 00:00:06.033
- I am the Waffler, with
my griddle of justice

00:00:06.066 --> 00:00:09.800
I bash the enemy in the
head or I burn them like so.

