- [Pencil Head] We erase crime.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.133
- Two generations of...

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:24.033
- Right.
- Yes, thank you.

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:26.833
(arms whooshing)

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.666
(crowd screaming)

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:36.333
- I'd say there's potential.

